5. Simulation Protocol

5.1 Initialization

Initialize geometry (X(0))

Initialize node states (R(0))

Initialize ledger (L(0))

Choose timestep (\Delta t)

Choose total simulation time (T)

5.2 Evolution Loop

for t in [0, T]:

    X = X + Δt * G( QFE( Ingest(t) ) ) + sigma_X * noise()

    for each node i:
        interactions = Σ_j C(i, j, R[i], R[j])
        R[i] = R[i] + Δt * ( D(i, X, R[i]) + interactions ) \
               + sigma_i * noise()

    events = Detect(R, X)
    L = UpdateLedger(L, events)

